WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.276 --> 00:00:03.322
- [Narrator] Going to gay
bars has become predictable.

00:00:03.322 --> 00:00:06.989
I always knew exactly
who I'm going to meet.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:14.286
Meet The Lez-boi, she's the
one wearing the flatback.

00:00:14.286 --> 00:00:16.093
She may look like a social butterfly,

00:00:16.093 --> 00:00:18.232
but she has into the slightest clue

00:00:18.232 --> 00:00:20.061
when it comes to flirting.

00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:22.978
Oh great, there's The Happy Couple.

00:00:23.903 --> 00:00:27.832
What on earth are they even doing here?

00:00:27.832 --> 00:00:32.765
We get it, you're in love
just get the (beep) out.

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:35.101
There's The Ultra-Femme.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:40.078
This girl is in her element,
she is glamorous and Fierce.

00:00:40.078 --> 00:00:44.245
Ah, the Alpha, also
known as the (beep) girl.

00:00:46.134 --> 00:00:47.471
You hate to love her.

00:00:47.471 --> 00:00:50.316
She has the perfect
hair, the perfect style

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:52.399
and the perfect charisma.

00:00:53.266 --> 00:00:57.195
This girl has probably never
had to buy her own drink.

00:00:57.195 --> 00:00:59.188
Here comes The Tourist.

00:00:59.188 --> 00:01:01.708
She's the straight girl at the bar.

00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:04.006
Her attempts to blend in will amuse you,

00:01:04.006 --> 00:01:05.794
but rest assure she'll find a way

00:01:05.794 --> 00:01:08.807
to get the attention she's looking for.

00:01:08.807 --> 00:01:12.957
There's The Butch, she's
watching you from the pool table.

00:01:12.957 --> 00:01:16.643
Don't be fooled by her scowls,
she is way more intimidated

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:18.876
by her surroundings than you think.

00:01:18.876 --> 00:01:23.043
And then there's this girl,
the one who hates the bar, me.

00:01:26.314 --> 00:01:28.205
Why am I even here?

00:01:28.205 --> 00:01:31.372
(light upbeat music)

00:01:36.505 --> 00:01:37.338
Oh.

00:01:40.096 --> 00:01:42.291
See you next weekend.

00:01:42.291 --> 00:01:44.958
(upbeat music)

